{"id":96,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"大学附属の研究的な学びで主体性を育む","feature_description":"千葉大学教育学部附属中学校は、大学附属校として教育研究や実習と関わりながら、日々の教育活動を行う学校です。基礎学力の定着に加え、探究的な学び、学校行事、協働的な活動を通して、自分の考えを表現する力を育てます。大学と連携する環境の中で、主体性と社会性を伸ばします。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":1619,"name":"野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1620,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1621,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1622,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1623,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1624,"name":"書道","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1625,"name":"男子ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1626,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1627,"name":"園芸","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1628,"name":"女子ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1629,"name":"吹奏楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1630,"name":"家庭科","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jr.chiba-u.jp/documents/reimei/r5-reimei-1.